      "text": "cheap tier\n   intake · question drafts · fetch_agent\n   batch_extract · normalise_skills\nstrong tier\n   plan · broaden · write_brief (+ revise)\nfallbacks: DeepSeek v4 Flash → GLM 5.3 Flash\nbad structured output is retried with the\nvalidation error, then the next model",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "cheap tier\n   intake · question drafts · fetch_agent\n   batch_extract · normalise_skills\nstrong tier\n   plan · broaden · write_brief (+ revise)\nfallbacks: DeepSeek v4 Flash → GLM 5.3 Flash\nbad structured output is retried with the\nvalidation error, then the next model",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
